    "1.1 (2026-09-30): Loader and observability fixes only. No expected value changed. (1) E6-out and E6-in now carry atomic_group 'transfer-E6', because storage refuses a lone internal-transfer leg at commit. (2) S1: on the three values replay builds without a position (account quantity, account cash, portfolio cash) the detail is now null ('not asserted'). The reason NOT_RECONSTRUCTABLE has exactly one cause, BEFORE_SNAPSHOT, so the detail adds no information there. S1's account_status now also asserts snapshot_date 2025-06-30, which carries the audit information (where history starts). See CP1_GOLDEN_FIXTURE_DERIVATION.md §7.",
    "1.0 (2026-09-30): first issue, ratified by quant-analyst."
